<pre class=metadata>
Title: Test
ED: http://example.com/foo
Date: 1970-01-01
Editor: Example Editor
Group: test
Status: LS
Shortname: test
Markup Shorthands: markdown on
Abstract: Verifying that multiple constructs with the same "name" don't interfere with finding methods.
</pre>

`includes` statements also have a name equal to the first interface.

<xmp class=idl>
Foo includes Bar;
interface Foo {
    undefined fooMethod(DOMString fooArg);
};
Foo includes Baz;
interface Bar {};
interface Baz {};
</xmp>

<pre class=argumentdef for="Foo/fooMethod(fooArg)">
	fooArg: Description of the {{Foo}} to create.
</pre>
